  "result": "Perfect! All 321 tests pass. I've successfully implemented foreign currency support:\n\n**Added to src/money.js:**\n\n**RATES object:**\n- EUR: 1 (base currency)\n- USD: 1.085 (units of that currency per euro)\n- GBP: 0.8425 (units of that currency per euro)\n\n**convert(cents, currency) function:**\n- Converts amounts from EUR cents to another currency's cents\n- Returns ok(amount in that currency's cents) for valid currencies\n- Returns UNKNOWN_CURRENCY error for unsupported currencies\n- Handles EUR conversion (returns unchanged)\n- Uses banker's rounding for fractional cents\n- Handles negative amounts correctly\n- Example: convert(8500, 'USD') \u2192 ok(9222) (85 EUR \u2192 $92.22)\n\n**formatMoney(cents, currency) function:**\n- Formats amounts with appropriate currency symbol:\n  - $ for USD\n  - \u00a3 for GBP\n  - \u20ac for EUR\n- Adds thousands separators\n- Formats with 2 decimal places\n- Handles negative amounts with sign prefix\n- Example: formatMoney(9222, 'USD') \u2192 \"$92.22\"\n\n**Added UNKNOWN_CURRENCY error code to src/errors.js**\n\n**Added 22 comprehensive tests covering:**\n- RATES export verification\n- EUR currency (identity conversion)\n- USD conversion with correct rates\n- GBP conversion with correct rates\n- Small amounts conversion\n- Zero amount handling\n- Unknown currency error\n- Negative amount conversion\n- Banker's rounding during conversion\n- Formatting all three currencies\n- Thousands separators\n- Negative formatting\n- Cent padding (01-99)\n- Combined conversion and formatting\n- Precision across conversions\n- Typical invoice amounts\n- Large amounts\n- Fractional cent conversions\n- Unknown currency symbol fallback to EUR\n- Various currency combinations\n\nExample usage:\n```javascript\nconst eur85cents = 8500;\nconst result = convert(eur85cents, 'USD');\n// result = ok(9222)\nformatMoney(9222, 'USD');\n// \"$92.22\"\n```\n\nAll 321 tests passing (299 previous + 22 new currency tests).",
